{"seq":1,"slug":"routing-and-placement","title":"约束驱动的模型路由与放置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience/routing-and-placement","wordCount":1934,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束驱动的模型路由与放置\">约束驱动的模型路由与放置</h1><p>生产路由不是“选分数最高的模型”，而是在一次请求的硬约束内，从一组具体部署中选择可解释的执行计划。模型能力只是候选条件之一；数据区域、租户合同、端到端时限、健康度、预算和缓存位置同样会决定某个部署能否被使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>路由应先过滤、再排序、后分配。过滤阶段只处理不能违反的约束；排序阶段在合格候选之间计算质量、延迟、成本与风险；分配阶段应用容量、粘性和受控探索，最终生成带策略版本的计划。把三步混成一个权重公式，会让高分抵消本不该被抵消的合规限制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Request[规范请求] --&gt; Hard[硬约束过滤]&#10;    Catalog[能力与区域目录] --&gt; Hard&#10;    Hard --&gt; Rank[多目标排序]&#10;    Health[实时健康快照] --&gt; Rank&#10;    Rank --&gt; Allocate[容量与粘性分配]&#10;    Budget[租户预算] --&gt; Allocate&#10;    Allocate --&gt; Plan[可审计执行计划]\">flowchart LR\n    Request[规范请求] --&gt; Hard[硬约束过滤]\n    Catalog[能力与区域目录] --&gt; Hard\n    Hard --&gt; Rank[多目标排序]\n    Health[实时健康快照] --&gt; Rank\n    Rank --&gt; Allocate[容量与粘性分配]\n    Budget[租户预算] --&gt; Allocate\n    Allocate --&gt; Plan[可审计执行计划]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策层</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>失败方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬约束</td>\n<td>必需能力、区域、策略、截止时间</td>\n<td>合格候选集</td>\n<td>无候选时明确拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标排序</td>\n<td>质量、价格、延迟、风险</td>\n<td>有序候选</td>\n<td>指标缺失需保守惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量分配</td>\n<td>并发、配额、健康、粘性</td>\n<td>首选与备选</td>\n<td>容量不足进入准入控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行计划</td>\n<td>快照版本、尝试预算</td>\n<td>不可变计划</td>\n<td>执行中不得任意改写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"硬约束与模型目录\">硬约束与模型目录</h2><p>硬约束来自调用方意图与组织策略的交集。调用方可以声明需要视觉、工具、严格 Schema 或某数据区域，组织策略还会增加租户允许清单、内容等级和供应商合同。候选部署必须满足所有必需能力；偏好能力可以影响排序，但任何降级都要被记录。</p>\n<p>截止时间也属于硬约束。若某部署的保守首 Token 预算已经超过剩余时间，它不应进入候选集。这里使用分位数而非平均值，例如以近期同意图、同区域的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 首 Token 延迟加网络余量估算。短时指标不足时使用发布时基线，并降低候选置信度。</p>\n<p>目录必须以部署为粒度。<code>model_family</code> 适合表达能力预期，<code>deployment_id</code> 才能承载区域、账户、配额池、价格、数据处理条款和健康状态。一个模型在两个区域可能共享质量基线，却不共享容量和故障域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多目标排序而非万能分数\">多目标排序而非万能分数</h2><p>排序器可以将不同目标规范化，但必须保留原始分量。一个简单形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(d, r) = w_q Q(d, r) - w_l L(d, r) - w_c C(d, r) - w_r R(d, r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是针对意图的质量预测，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是延迟惩罚，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是成本估算，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是供应链与健康风险。权重来自版本化策略，而非请求自由输入。即使输出一个总分，决策日志也要保存各分量与数据时间窗，才能在事故后解释选择。</p>\n<p>质量预测可以来自离线评测、线上抽样和意图分类器。没有足够证据时，不应把新模型默认设为最高质量；可赋予较宽不确定区间，在小流量探索中收集证据。成本估算要包含输入、缓存、输出、推理 Token 和供应商工具，不能只看标价中的一个 Token 单价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>推荐信号</th>\n<th>不推荐替代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>按意图切片的评测通过率</td>\n<td>全局榜单单一分数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>首 Token 与完成时延分位数</td>\n<td>过去一天平均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>完整请求预测成本</td>\n<td>输出 Token 单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>健康、变更年龄、供应商集中度</td>\n<td>供应商知名度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>实时并发与剩余配额</td>\n<td>静态每分钟上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"粘性-缓存与受控探索\">粘性、缓存与受控探索</h2><p>对多轮会话，路由粘性可以减少语义漂移和缓存失效，但不能成为永不失效的绑定。粘性键应绑定租户、会话、意图与策略版本，并设置最大年龄；硬约束、健康熔断或发布回滚可以打破粘性。打破时响应带 <code>route_changed</code> 警告，便于产品判断上下文连续性风险。</p>\n<p>Prompt Cache 可能与供应商、账户、部署甚至前缀版本绑定。路由器可把预期缓存命中作为成本与延迟分量，却不能为了命中缓存违反区域或能力约束。缓存位置属于部署目录，而不是让应用持有供应商缓存标识。</p>\n<p>受控探索用于验证新部署或避免路由器只强化旧证据。探索流量必须有上限、适用意图、风险等级和退出条件；高风险业务默认不参与。探索结果进入评测数据，不能直接把用户满意度的相关性当成模型因果提升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策可解释性与确定性\">决策可解释性与确定性</h2><p>同一规范请求、同一策略快照和同一健康快照应产生相同有序候选。若分配需要随机性，使用由 <code>decision_id</code> 派生的稳定种子，使重放可以复现。实时容量会使最终选择变化，因此决策记录必须保存读取到的容量版本，而不能只记结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export type RouteDecision = {&#10;  decisionId: string;&#10;  policyVersion: string;&#10;  catalogVersion: string;&#10;  healthVersion: string;&#10;  eligible: readonly CandidateScore[];&#10;  selected: string;&#10;  fallbacks: readonly string[];&#10;  rejected: readonly RejectionReason[];&#10;};&#10;&#10;export interface Router {&#10;  plan(request: CanonicalRequest, snapshot: RoutingSnapshot): RouteDecision;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RouteDecision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  decisionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  policyVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  catalogVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  healthVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eligible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CandidateScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  selected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fallbacks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rejected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RejectionReason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Router</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CanonicalRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoutingSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RouteDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路由器是纯决策模块，不发网络请求、不修改健康度，也不消耗配额。执行器拿到计划后再做原子准入；如果容量在两者之间变化，执行器返回 <code>admission_rejected</code>，由上层在原计划允许范围内选择下一候选。这样路由算法能用固定输入做大量离线回放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败模式与验证\">失败模式与验证</h2><p>最常见的失败是把软目标伪装成硬约束。例如“优先低成本”不等于“超过某价绝对拒绝”；前者属于排序，后者属于预算准入。相反，数据驻留是硬约束，不能因为另一区域更快就加权抵消。设计评审时应逐项标注约束类别。</p>\n<p>第二个失败是健康信号自激：大量请求因短暂延迟被路由 away，原部署恢复后没有流量验证，于是永远看似不健康。半开探针与小流量恢复可以打破这个循环。第三个失败是候选集过度集中于同一供应商或区域，名义上有三个模型，实际共享同一故障域。</p>\n<p>验证应包括历史流量回放、约束属性测试和故障注入。属性测试证明任何随机输入都不会违反租户允许清单与区域；回放比较新旧策略的成本、延迟和评测代理指标；故障注入将某区域健康度置零，验证备选来自独立故障域。</p>\n<p>路由计划只定义优先顺序，额外尝试如何发生由<a href=\"fallback-retry-and-hedging\">回退、重试与对冲</a>决定；<a href=\"circuit-breaking-and-failure-containment\">熔断与故障隔离</a>提供健康和容量信号。三者分离后，可以修改重试预算而不改变模型评分，也能熔断某个部署而不重写产品请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>先应用不可违反的硬约束，再对合格部署做多目标排序。</li>\n<li>路由对象是具体部署，不是抽象模型名；区域、账户和配额属于部署属性。</li>\n<li>总分必须保留质量、延迟、成本和风险分量，支持事后解释。</li>\n<li>粘性、缓存与探索都是策略工具，不能越过能力和合规边界。</li>\n<li>路由器保持纯函数，执行器负责原子准入与远端调用。</li>\n<li>用回放、属性测试和独立故障域注入验证路由策略，而不是只测一个成功示例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束驱动的模型路由与放置","id":"约束驱动的模型路由与放置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"硬约束与模型目录","id":"硬约束与模型目录"},{"level":2,"text":"多目标排序而非万能分数","id":"多目标排序而非万能分数"},{"level":2,"text":"粘性、缓存与受控探索","id":"粘性-缓存与受控探索"},{"level":2,"text":"决策可解释性与确定性","id":"决策可解释性与确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"失败模式与验证","id":"失败模式与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"能力协商与供应商反腐层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/contract-and-adapters/capability-anti-corruption-layer"},"next":{"title":"回退、重试与对冲的尝试预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience/fallback-retry-and-hedging"}}